de.description:
Open this link in a browser and log in with your DHL Kundenkonto: {authorize_url}

Your browser will fail to open the final `dhllogin://…` redirect — that is expected. This address never appears in the address bar; you catch it in your browser's developer tools' Network tab instead — see [step-by-step instructions]({docs_url}). Paste the full address below.

Note: DHL's tracking endpoint only responds correctly to a German IP address — this integration will not work if your Home Assistant reaches the internet from another country.
